    "summary": "At the beginning of your Command phase, you may pick a friendly NECRONS INFANTRY CHARACTER other than Trazyn who is on the battlefield. EPIC HERO and SKORPEKH LORD models are excluded. Destroy the chosen model without resolving rules that trigger on its destruction. Put Trazyn in that position with full wounds. He inherits command of any unit the casualty led.",
